DATASET LICENSES:

This project uses data from the following sources:

1. BraTS 2020/2021 Dataset
   - Source: https://www.med.upenn.edu/cbica/brats2020/
   - License: Custom license (registration required)
   - Usage: Research and education only

2. Figshare Brain Tumor Dataset
   - Source: https://figshare.com/articles/brain_tumor_dataset/1512427
   - License: CC BY 4.0
   - Citation: Cheng, Jun (2017): brain tumor dataset. figshare. Dataset.

3. Kaggle Brain Tumor MRI Dataset
   - Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/masoudnickparvar/brain-tumor-mri-dataset
   - License: Public Domain
   - Citation: Nickparvar, Masoud (2021): Brain Tumor MRI Dataset. Kaggle.

Please respect the licenses of these datasets when using this software.

